      "content": "That is a valid concern regarding the intricate, optimized logic within the Polaris core. If the new architecture cannot accommodate these nuances, the migration risks a significant performance regression. Perhaps we can dedicate a small, parallel task to creating a detailed functional specification of these non-standard flows first, rather than just documentation. This specification could then serve as a precise blueprint for the Nexus-9 team to replicate the required behavior.",
